guardianshipagreementsigneddate, relationshipid, guardiancommitmentforpermanentchildcare, clientid, dateofbirth, removalcourtorderdate, 
appropriatepermanencyforchildoption1notbeingreturnedhome, countyofjurisdiction_ldss, childguardianattachment, childguardianid, gender, 
childname, childremovaldate, ageappropriateconsultationtakenplacewiththechild, secondguardianexists, appropriatepermanencyforchildoption2notbeingadopted,
successorguardianexists, guardianshipfinalizationdate, numberofadditionalhouseholdmembers, gapeligibilitystatus, childmeetcontinueeligibilitycriteria, childdisabilityevaluationdocumentiondate, startdateofsecondaryeducationorequivalentprogram, nameofpostsecondaryorvocationaleducation,
